For doc walk:
```python
def walk(node, path=()):
    if isinstance(node, dict):
        for k,v in node.items(): yield from walk(v, path+(str(k),))
    elif isinstance(node, list):
        for i,v in enumerate(node): yield from walk(v, path+(str(i),))
    else:
        yield path, node
```
